        <mxCell id="oidc" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Every row&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: the job asks GitHub for an OIDC token with audience sts.amazonaws.com and calls sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity. STS checks the token against the GitHub OIDC provider that the account baseline creates in every account, then against the role&#x27;s trust condition on the token&#x27;s sub claim." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;spacingRight=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;align=left;spacingLeft=50;spacingTop=3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="org">
