        <mxCell id="lg_facts" value="Every person signs in through Google Workspace with MFA. No IAM user exists in any account.&lt;br&gt;Humans: ReadOnly everywhere, write only in Dev (Developer), Shared Services and Security Tooling (PlatformAdmin or SecurityAnalyst), Management (OrgAdmin); BreakGlass in Staging, Prod, Backup.&lt;br&gt;F numbers are the flows of target-state/organization.&lt;br&gt;Numbers in circles give the order of the steps in a lane. Angle brackets mark a placeholder." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="leg">
